sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 사용자
    participant Controller as CouponController
    participant Service as CouponService
    participant Repository as CouponRepositoryImpl
    participant Cache as CouponCacheRepository
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant DB as Database
    participant Scheduler as CouponScheduler
    participant Processor as CouponIssueProcessor
    participant Lock as DistributedLock

    Note over User, Lock: 1. 쿠폰 발급 요청 단계
    User->>Controller: POST /coupons/{id}/issue-requests
    Controller->>Service: requestCouponIssue(CouponCommand.Issue)
    Service->>Repository: findById(couponId)
    Repository->>DB: SELECT * FROM coupon WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>Repository: Coupon
    Repository-->>Service: Coupon
    Service->>Service: coupon.validateIssuable() - 발급 가능 검증
    Service->>Repository: isIssuedMember(couponId, userId)
    Repository->>Cache: isMember(couponId, userId)
    Cache->>Redis: SISMEMBER coupon:{id}:issued {userId}
    Redis-->>Cache: false (미발급 확인)
    Cache-->>Repository: false
    Repository-->>Service: false
    Service->>Repository: addRequest(couponId, userId)
    Repository->>Cache: addRequest(couponId, userId)
    Cache->>Redis: ZADD coupon:{id}:requests {timestamp} {userId}
    Redis-->>Cache: 1 (성공)
    Cache-->>Repository: true
    Repository-->>Service: true
    Service-->>Controller: true
    Controller-->>User: 요청 성공 응답

    Note over Scheduler, Lock: 2. 스케줄러 주기적 처리 (매 1분)
    Scheduler->>Repository: findIssuableCoupons(now-1분)
    Repository->>DB: SELECT * FROM coupon WHERE issue_start_at <= ? AND issue_end_at >= ?
    DB-->>Repository: List<Coupon>
    Repository-->>Scheduler: List<Coupon>

    loop 각 쿠폰마다
        Scheduler->>Processor: processCouponIssuance(coupon)

        Note over Processor, Redis: 3. 대기열에서 선착순 사용자 조회
        Processor->>Repository: getRequestsByTimestamp(couponId, issuableCount)
        Repository->>Cache: getRequestsByTimestamp(couponId, limit)
        Cache->>Redis: ZRANGE coupon:{id}:requests 0 {limit-1} WITHSCORES
        Redis-->>Cache: [(userId1, timestamp1), (userId2, timestamp2)...]
        Cache-->>Repository: Set<TypedTuple<Long>>
        Repository-->>Processor: 타임스탬프 순 정렬된 사용자 목록

        Note over Processor, DB: 4. 배치 쿠폰 발급 처리
        loop 각 사용자마다
            Processor->>Repository: findById(userId) - User 조회
            Repository->>DB: SELECT * FROM user WHERE id = ?
            DB-->>Repository: User
            Repository-->>Processor: User
            Processor->>Processor: coupon.issueAt(user, requestTime) - 쿠폰 발급
            Note right of Processor: coupon.issuedQuantity++ (메모리에서)
        end

        Note over Processor, Redis: 5. 처리 결과 캐시 저장
        Processor->>Repository: addIssuance(couponId, successfulUserIds)
        Repository->>Cache: addIssuance(couponId, userIds)
        Cache->>Redis: PIPELINE: SADD coupon:{id}:issued {userId1} {userId2}...
        Redis-->>Cache: OK

        Processor->>Repository: removeRequests(couponId, processedCount)
        Repository->>Cache: removeRequests(couponId, limit)
        Cache->>Redis: ZREMRANGEBYRANK coupon:{id}:requests 0 {limit-1}
        Redis-->>Cache: OK

        opt 실패한 사용자가 있는 경우
            Processor->>Repository: addFailures(couponId, failedUserIds)
            Repository->>Cache: addFailures(couponId, failedUserIds)
            Cache->>Redis: PIPELINE: SADD coupon:{id}:failed {userId}...
            Redis-->>Cache: OK
        end
    end

    Note over User, Lock: 6. 즉시 쿠폰 발급 (동기 처리)
    User->>Controller: POST /coupons/{id}/issue
    Controller->>Service: issueCoupon(CouponCommand.Issue)
    Note over Service, Lock: Redisson 분산락 적용
    Lock->>Redis: LOCK coupon:{couponId}
    Service->>Repository: findById(couponId)
    Repository->>DB: SELECT * FROM coupon WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>Repository: Coupon
    Repository-->>Service: Coupon
    Service->>Service: coupon.issue(user) - 쿠폰 발급
    Service->>Repository: save(couponIssue)
    Repository->>DB: INSERT INTO coupon_issue...
    DB-->>Repository: CouponIssue
    Repository-->>Service: CouponIssue
    Lock->>Redis: UNLOCK coupon:{couponId}
    Service-->>Controller: CouponInfo
    Controller-->>User: 발급 완료 응답